and then thinking about if that's true&nbsp;
who is it that I really need to know if&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:29.760
hypothetically if I could have a hundred&nbsp;
people over time be my champions and mentors&nbsp;&nbsp;

