any one really delicious unexpected uh nugget from&nbsp;
their life experience that makes them memorable&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.880 --> 00:04:03.040
tell people share with people what was why was&nbsp;
this particular of all the possible stories in the&nbsp;&nbsp;

