universe why this one what's the connective tissue&nbsp;
why was that so important to you that you put&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:08.960 --> 00:04:15.440
all your soul equity into creating this and&nbsp;
a third leg of this school very important is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:20.320
don't just send it out randomly&nbsp;
if I want to send you this project&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:21.280 --> 00:04:25.760
why you why have I chosen you not&nbsp;
because your name was in a directory&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:34.480
I researched you there was some one film that you&nbsp;
made perhaps that was um like I got sucker punched&nbsp;&nbsp;

